HIMES-la appointment workflow romba simple-ah irukkum. Idhu epdi work aagum nu step-by-step solren:

1. **Doctor Schedule Setup:** Modhalla, doctors-oda working hours, leaves, matrum consultation time slots (15 or 30 mins) system-la configure pannuvom.
2. **Booking:** Front-desk staff patient-oda MRN illana name vechu search panni, doctor-oda available slot-la appointment book pannuvanga.
